gional  support the agitation statements  and the cmec integration and cmx stands  for customer management encryption keys  now in terms of the global  multi-regional support  um first of all we we have cloud hsn  available  in all our cloud regions so any region  that you choose today  should have cloud hsn available with it  as well and so  you know it has a large footprint and  it's probably one of the largest  um you know footprints for for hsn  service that you'll find anywhere to be  quite honest  um the other thing is that it will be  you you have the capability of actually  creating a multi-region with their cloud  hsn keys  and what that means is that when you  create a key in a multi-region  it's available across that geography  so for example if you create a key  within the us region  then that key is accessible through  through different areas within the  united states it's available across the  across the country so that if uh for for  whatever reason  your particular region goes dark which  hopefully never happens  then that key exists in other areas and  other  regions or not other other parts of the  country so that your application can  migrate over to a different  different part of the country and the  key will just be there it will be  completely available  and when you make changes to a key in a  multi-region the key  the changes are reflected everywhere so  it it happens in  almost instantaneously so it's it's  truly a multi-region it's not  a backup and restore so in other  other schemes you may see systems where  you actually are basically  taking your backup and restoring and  cloning it to a different region so that  you basically kind of mimic  uh having having two regions and having  a kind of business continuity solution  ours is a little more automated than  that just to find your key to being a  multi-region and just exist there now  we recently also announced support for  global  global regional support which means that  if you create 